7. Open questions to resolve in the design
1. What counts as “machine-verified proof” for a token-efficiency claim? The ET regression artifact, the cache-hit provenance, or the verifier output? Define the artifact format.
2. What is the default regression tolerance ε? Zero is safest but may block legitimate improvements that trade a small token increase for a large quality gain; the override mechanism exists for this, but the default needs a policy.
